# FinanceFlow AI — Human-Controlled Agent Execution System Walkthrough

## Summary of Accomplishments

We have successfully designed, migrated, and implemented the **Human-Controlled Agent Execution System** for FinanceFlow AI.

---

## 1. Key Architectural Upgrades

### 🛡️ Payment Arrival ≠ AI Execution (Token Safeguard)
- **Payment Ingestion**: When a new payment arrives, a reconciliation case is created in state **`NEW`**. **No Groq LLM tokens are consumed automatically.**
- **Human Control**: The accountant views cases on the Action Center dashboard and explicitly triggers **`[⚡ Analyze with AI]`** when investigation is needed.

### ⚡ Deterministic Pre-Check Engine (Zero-Token Matcher)
- Before calling Groq LLM, every case passes through `runPreCheckEngine`:
  - **Duplicate Check**: Prevents re-analyzing already processed payments.
  - **Company Bank Account Match**: Matches sender bank account to corporate borrowers (+40 pts).
  - **Due Repayment Amount Match**: Exact amount match against active loan schedule (+30 pts).
  - **Reference / Narration Match**: Matches loan number string in reference (+20 pts).
- **Threshold**: If score $\ge$ `RECONCILIATION_PRECHECK_THRESHOLD` (85), recommendation is created **without calling Groq LLM** (`0 tokens`).
- If score $< 85$, Agent 1 activates Groq LLM tool-calling (`qwen/qwen3.6-27b`).

### 🔒 Run Locks & Duplicate Protection
- Concurrent execution of the same case returns HTTP `409 Conflict` ("Case is currently being processed by an agent").
- Analyzing an already-analyzed case returns existing recommendation without re-running LLM.

### 📊 AI Agent Control Center (Observability & Governance)
- **New Sidebar Tab**: Added **`AI Agent Control`** tab with `Bot` icon.
- **6 Agent Cards**:
  - **Agent 1** (Payment Reconciliation): Live metrics, `● READY`
  - **Agent 2** (Repayment Risk): Live metrics, `● READY`
  - **Agent 3** (Collection Follow-Up): Live metrics, `● READY`
  - **Agent 4** (Document Intelligence): Live metrics, `● READY`
  - **Agent 5** (Portfolio Analytics): `COMING SOON` (No fake metrics!)
  - **Agent 6** (Notification & Escalation): `COMING SOON` (No fake metrics!)
- **Total Token Counter**: Live tracking of aggregate LLM token consumption across all runs.
- **Recent Agent Activity Timeline Feed**: Filterable by Agent and Trigger type.
- **Agent Run History & Log Inspector Drawer**: Slide-over drawer with expandable step-by-step execution logs (`agent_execution_logs`).

### ⚡ Bulk Analysis Controls
- **Multi-Select Checkboxes**: Select multiple cases in the Recent Cases table.
- **`[⚡ Analyze Selected (N)]`**: Capped at max 20 cases per batch.
- **`[⚡ Analyze All NEW (N)]`**: Capped at max 50 cases per batch with a confirmation dialog:
  > *"You are about to analyze N cases using AI. This may consume approximately X AI requests."*
- **Max Concurrency**: Bulk jobs run in parallel worker batches of max **5 concurrent runs**.

